      "entries": [
        "The xilvirek retches a small pool of debilitating, acrid bile onto itself. All creatures within 30 feet take 4d6 acid damage as they inhale the bile's noxious fumes (DC 32 basic Fortitude save; on a failure, the creature is sickened|CRB|sickened 1, or sickened|CRB|sickened 2 on a critical failure). The xilvirek can't Disgorge Bile again for 1d4 rounds."
